
-- Complete Starter - A functional mini-bot showcasing key Moringa features
-- This combines greetings, memory, and context concepts into one working bot
-- Try: "hello", "enter work", "help", "goodbye"

-- Basic greeting - responds to "hello"
Recognizer "hello"
	Remember "User greeted me"
	Option Say "Hello! Welcome to Moringa!"
	Option Say "Hi there! Nice to meet you."

-- Case-sensitive greeting - responds to "Hello"
Recognizer "Hello"
	Remember "User greeted me politely"
	Option Say "Hello! Thanks for being polite."

-- Goodbye patterns
Recognizer "bye"
	Remember "User said goodbye"
	Option Say "Goodbye! Thanks for trying Moringa."

Recognizer "goodbye"
	Remember "User said goodbye"
	Option Say "See you later!"

Recognizer "enter work"
	Enter "work"
	Remember "User entered work mode"
	Option Say "Entering work mode. Time to be productive!"

Recognizer "help"
	Remember "User asked for help"
	Option Say "I'm a starter bot! Try: 'hello', 'enter work', 'goodbye'"

